oir"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Je suis celui qui a introduit le sujet.","en":"I'm the one who brought the subject up.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"the one"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"subject, topic"}]},{"text":"Le voleur s'est introduit par la fenêtre.","en":"The thief snuck in through the window.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"robber, thief"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"window"}]},{"text":"C'est moi qui ai introduit le sujet.","en":"I'm the one who brought the subject up.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"subject, topic"}]}]}